type: software
title: "Type Fact: An Interactive Typing Tutor for CS, ML, AI, and Computational Biology"
authors:
  - family-names: Nelson
    given-names: David R.
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/olympus-terminal/type-fact
keywords:
  - typing tutor
  - computer science education
